# Correspondence drafts — PERSONAL, never commit (owner instruction 2026-07-27).
# These are permission/enquiry emails to third parties and contain other
# people's names and contact addresses. 17 of them had been tracked and were
# PUBLIC on GitHub until they were purged from history on 2026-07-27; the
# purge is only durable if they stay ignored. Keep them on disk, out of git.
store-assets/*_draft.txt
store-assets/*_drafts.txt
store-assets/*draft*.txt
store-assets/*_reply*.txt

